WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:42.955
Everyone but Eddy was skidding.

2
00:00:42.956 --> 00:00:46.444
Suddenly Zippy flew by.

3
00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:51.225
Eddy jumped out of the way.

4
00:00:51.226 --> 00:00:54.781
Zippy skidded fast across the lot.

5
00:00:54.782 --> 00:00:58.712
His tires left long dark marks.

6
00:00:58.713 --> 00:01:02.930
Smoke filled the air.

7
00:01:02.931 --> 00:01:13.241
"Wow!" said Poppy.

8
00:01:13.242 --> 00:01:17.008
"That was cool, Zippy!" said the van.

9
00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:20.172
"I know," said Zippy.

10
00:01:20.173 --> 00:01:22.820
Zippy took off again.

11
00:01:22.821 --> 00:01:26.378
He stopped far away.

12
00:01:26.379 --> 00:01:29.200
His engine rumbled.

13
00:01:29.201 --> 00:01:32.553
"Watch this!" Zippy yelled.

14
00:01:32.554 --> 00:01:35.023
Roar!

15
00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:38.402
Zippy zoomed back toward everyone.

16
00:01:38.403 --> 00:01:41.057
He made a sharp turn.

17
00:01:41.058 --> 00:01:46.136
Then he skidded in circles!

18
00:01:46.137 --> 00:01:49.435
"Whoa!" said the jeep.

19
00:01:49.436 --> 00:01:58.016
"Zippy is the best!" said the van.

20
00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:01.395
"Yes, I am!" said Zippy.

21
00:02:01.396 --> 00:02:05.467
Suddenly—Roar!

22
00:02:05.468 --> 00:02:14.202
Eddy shot across the parking lot!
